{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56093","headline":"通玄赞八首 八 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道化三元布，神凝万像分。\n龙汉开玄籙，天书下赤浑。\n应期铿法鼓，随方啓妙门。\n太上垂至赜，威德被乾坤。\n神经三一侍，妙理五千文。\n字列金华府，名传玉帝君。\n心中生宝日，身上起罗云。\n十仙何足友，载刼乃长存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}